 "limits": "CORRECTION, recorded so it is not re-derived: an earlier pass read SimGame3Farmland (40 rows, consume item id \"4\" = Diamond) as the plot table and priced plots in crystals. That was wrong. Plots are SimGame3Field and are bought with Knowledge -- proved by the client (SimGame3Manager:ReqOpenField updates knowledgeScore and logs gain_know from=\"reclamation\"; LevelSimGame3:OnLevelLoaded creates one plot per zxSimGame3FieldConfigs row) and corroborated by the original rule text Rule:text:SimGame3Main_8 \"With enough Knowledge, go ask Maxim to reclaim more land plots!\" and Rule:text:SimGame3NPC1. What SimGame3Farmland IS was NOT determined; it is only established that it is not this. autoTakecare / oneclickHarvest / oneclickSow are carried here for provenance but Everkai has no automation system to attach them to yet.",
